            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-category"} (∞,1)-category
          %p
            In
            %a{:href => "http://dspace.mit.edu/handle/1721.1/43792"} John Francis’ PhD thesis
            (reference
            %em EnAction
            below ) the theory of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-categories"} (∞,1)-categories
            equipped with an action of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/little+k-cubes+operad"} little k-cubes operad
            is established, so that
          %ul
            %li
              %p
